## Per-developer defaults (gitignored). Copy from defaults.properties.sample.
## defaultBaseUrl pre-fills the Connection panel's Worker URL on a fresh
## install; the stored DataStore value always wins once saved.
defaultBaseUrl=https://api.example.com
## applicationId is the store identity (namespace below stays fixed so R and
## BuildConfig imports never change). Keep com.example.* out of the store.
applicationId=com.example.zerozerowidget.hzos
## deviceToken pre-fills the API key field the same way. Paste a
## `device`-preset token from /admin. NEVER commit the real file — a bearer
## token baked into a shipped APK is a credential leak. Dev headsets only.
# deviceToken=
